{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-10-25 04:21:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS LAUNCHES FIRST GLOBAL SUITE METHANOL BUNKER FUEL PRICE ASSESSMENTS', 'text': 'SINGAPORE, OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYTICS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED\xa0THE LAUNCH OF TWO NEW DAILY METHANOL BUNKER FUEL PRICE ASSESSMENTS REFLECTING THE VALUE OF METHANOL USED AS A MARINE FUEL AT THE PORTS OF SINGAPORE AND HOUSTON, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 25, 2021. METHANOL IS ONE OF A NUMBER OF ALTERNATIVE MARINE FUELS AVAILABLE TO THE GLOBAL SHIPPING INDUSTRY.'}